                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'ol': [
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**Effective tax rate — section 57 of NTA.** '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'Where, in any year of assessment, the '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'effective tax rate (covered taxes as a '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'percentage of net income) of a company is '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**less than 15%**, such company shall '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**recompute and pay an additional tax** that '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'makes its effective tax rate equal to 15%. The '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'section applies to a company that is a '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'constituent entity of a **Multinational Entity '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'group with aggregate group turnover of at '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'least €750 million** or its equivalent, and to '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'any other company with an **aggregate turnover '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'of N50,000,000,000 and above** in the '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'financial year.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**Disclosure of tax planning — section 30 of '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'NTAA.** Taxpayers shall, **without notice or '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'request**, provide the relevant tax authority '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'with information relating to a disclosable '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'transaction or agreement.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**Non-registration and anti-contract splitting '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '— section 100(2) of NTAA.** A statutory body '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'or company that awards a contract to an '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**unregistered person** shall be liable to an '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'administrative penalty of **N5,000,000**.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**Power of substitution — section 60 of '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'NTAA.** The relevant tax authority is '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'empowered to **appoint any person as agent** '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'of a taxpayer where tax has become due and the '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'taxable person has refused or failed to pay, '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'and may require the agent to pay the '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'taxpayer\'s adjudged debt.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**Returns for virtual asset service providers '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '— section 25 of NTAA.** Virtual asset service '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'providers shall, with or without notice, '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'submit **monthly reports** to the relevant tax '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'authority.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**Information to be delivered by bankers and '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'others — section 29 of NTAA.** Financial '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'institutions shall prepare, with or without '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'demand by the Service, **annual returns** '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'specifying the names, customer location and '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'transactions of new and existing customers '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'where cumulative monthly transactions reach '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**N50 million** (an individual) or **N250 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'million** (a body corporate).',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**Deductible interest — section 20(1)(a) of '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'NTA and the Third Schedule.** Any **excess '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'interest** — total interest paid or payable to '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'a **connected person** in excess of **30% of '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'EBITDA** of the Nigerian company in that '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'accounting period — is a **disallowable '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'deduction** in ascertaining assessable profit.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**Value added tax fiscalisation system — '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'section 23 of NTAA.** Any person making a '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'taxable supply shall use the **electronic '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'fiscal system (EFS)** for recording and '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'reporting all supplies, where the Service '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'deploys an EFS.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ],
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'key': 'The eight provisions attack avoidance along '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            '**three different lines**, and grouping them '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'that way makes a better answer than a flat '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'list. **Minimum taxation** — the 15% effective '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'tax rate floor and the 30%-of-EBITDA interest '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'cap stop profit being stripped out of Nigeria. '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            '**Information** — mandatory disclosure of tax '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'planning, bank and VASP reporting, and the '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'e-invoicing fiscalisation system make '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'transactions visible before a return is filed. '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            '**Collection** — the power of substitution and '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'the contract-splitting penalty reach the tax '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'once it is due.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
